list.item:
Achilles, Theodore C., Member, Task Force on
                        Latin America; Counselor of the Department of State to February 15, 1961;
                        Director, Department of State Operations Center

Hilsman, Roger, Jr., Assistant Secretary of
                        State for Intelligence and Research, February 19, 1961-April 25, 1963;
                        Assistant Secretary of State for Far Eastern Affairs from May 9, 1963

person.note:
Assistant Special Counsel to President Kennedy until November 1961; Deputy Assistant Secretary of State
                    for Inter-American Affairs November 1961-January 1963; Secretary General,
                    International Peace Corps Secretariat, from January 1963

Chief, Latin America Division, Department of the Treasury to May 15, 1962;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American Affairs from May 16,
                    1962
